[{:db/id 17592186124652 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2369f308-07c0-5960-a63e-ec69f7d6d0c6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-2369f308-07c0-5960-a63e-ec69f7d6d0c6" :question/id #uuid "2369f308-07c0-5960-a63e-ec69f7d6d0c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-164509" :question/problem "Identify the surface $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+{z}^{2}=-1.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a hyperboloid of two sheets centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=-1.\n$$\n\nThus, a hyperboloid of two sheets centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $y$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a hyperboloid of two sheets whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis and $a=b=2,\\,c=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1dd15534-4a61-5493-b4d2-d4158ff665f2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1dd15534-4a61-5493-b4d2-d4158ff665f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "1dd15534-4a61-5493-b4d2-d4158ff665f2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d23fdde4-ee5e-5374-a3f3-a99631c545b8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c5cf1042-b2aa-561a-8222-86a9a28715cb" "answer-504a831f-3e0c-5d06-a8d1-be9b4ba80039" "answer-6b38cf9a-4a51-5286-8901-945e5c525367" "answer-d23fdde4-ee5e-5374-a3f3-a99631c545b8" "answer-58c388d4-2855-5447-9674-2cb26cd08e75"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c5cf1042-b2aa-561a-8222-86a9a28715cb" :answer/id #uuid "c5cf1042-b2aa-561a-8222-86a9a28715cb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbolic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-504a831f-3e0c-5d06-a8d1-be9b4ba80039" :answer/id #uuid "504a831f-3e0c-5d06-